## FIXES MADE THIS SESSION (chronological, for reference)

1. Merged the full real Pinterest prompt into MAIN_PROMPT.md (was a
   placeholder reference before, agents couldn't run it standalone)
2. Removed 2 closer lines from Pinterest's description rotation that
   falsely claimed "No AI" / "100% Real Nail Art" — images are AI-edited
   from source photos, so those lines were factually false
3. Located and locked Back to School's 6 links, expanded Fall (12+3
   shop) and Halloween (9+2 shop) from fixed 3-link lists to full
   rotating pools (Links File Section 8)
4. Fixed Facebook: added missing Image Prompt fields for Nail carousel
   (count rotates 3/4/5 by weekday) and Infographic+BGM (mobile 9:16)
5. Fixed Instagram: slide 5 no longer gets a swipe arrow (was showing
   incorrectly on the last slide); caption now requires the real
   article link written out, removed contradictory "link in bio" line
6. Added global "no em dash" rule across all platforms
7. Rebuilt X entirely: removed First Reply field system-wide, only
   Infographic slot keeps a link, Roundup posts no longer reference
   "below," Business posts fold CTA into post text instead of a
   separate field
8. Fixed YouTube: added missing Prompt field (mobile 9:16) — was
   generating Title/Description/Pinned Comment only, no way to
   actually create the Short's image

