## FILE LOCATIONS

- `MAIN_PROMPT.md` — the full prompt, ~820 lines
- `ALL_PLATFORM_LINKS.md` — all link pools, ~1410 lines, 8 sections
- Master site inventory source (re-fetch if pools need expanding):
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DADDYEAGER1/Mirelle_Inspo/refs/heads/main/Mirell%C3%A9/1%20aug%20content

Always verify any new/derived link list programmatically (count, zero
unintended duplicates, every link exists in the real site inventory)
before adding it to the Links File — this has caught real errors every
single time it's been done in this build.
